# Package layout

Single npm package (not a monorepo app):

```
src/
  dataGrid/       # DataGrid + sort helpers
  pagination/     # ListPagination + pure pagination helpers
  icons/          # Shared action icons
  index.ts        # Public exports
dist/             # tsc build output (published)
.github/workflows/ci.yml
```

- Run quality from **repo root**: `npm run quality`, `npm run build`, `npm test`.
- Publish only via CI on `main` (trusted publishing) unless the user explicitly asks otherwise.
- Keep peer deps minimal: `react`, `react-dom`.
